        <ArticleTitle>Screening automation with transformer models: a multi-review evaluation.</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText>Transformer-based classifiers were evaluated as title and abstract screeners across six completed reviews. Recall exceeded 0.95 in five of the six, with a mean workload reduction of 55 percent.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
