        <ArticleTitle>A crowd-plus-model pipeline for review screening.</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText>We combine non-expert crowd judgements with a machine-learning ranker to prioritise records for screening. The hybrid design matched expert recall at a third of the cost on two case-study reviews.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
