        <ArticleTitle>Query expansion for biomedical search using large language models.</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText>An LLM proposes synonyms and related MeSH concepts for a seed query. Expanded queries improved recall of a gold-standard reference set by 12 points at a modest precision cost.</AbstractText>
